    "type": "game",
    "name": "Elementail",
    "steam_appid": 3839890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We\u2019re Elementail's dev team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re thrilled to finally meet you on Steam\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and incredibly grateful you\u2019ve taken the time to check out our game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve poured countless late nights into crafting exciting strategy within the simplest mechanics: Draw, Store, and Strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 cards and relics, we\u2019ve been eager to share the joy of Elementail with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in battle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don\u2019t worry\u2014you\u2019ll come back stronger, ready to try a new strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback helps us grow and make Elementail even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please tell us your feedback on our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/d1901a011c81f9cc465ce4205ab54d98.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8dde189c53b0ee37b010cf925f3d3327.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a magical journey with adorable animal wizards, harnessing the power of Water, Fire, and Lightning elemental cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementail is a casual roguelike deckbuilder with the feel of a luxurious board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy and intuitive\u2014yes, even a squirrel could play it!\u2014but you'll need clever strategy to overcome quirky enemies and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a world where enchanted animals and elemental spirits coexist,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as a rookie wizard setting out to stop the growing elemental corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, the game\u2019s addictive card-drawing is a bit of a problem... but in the most lovable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/cec98e0e6682d60ae6a591af7ba51d3f.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=211 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Combat in Elementail is easy to learn but packed with strategic choices.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Draw] / [Store] / [Strike]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw as many cards as you like from your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to build up damage and strike down your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash same-element cards in a row for massive magical attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or mix different elements for unpredictable combos and wild effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/19cdf197a8a67655f9b8766f054be310.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=204 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Just one more card...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware your inner greed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdrawing could ruin your combo in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/c76bbf82944715ed148fa15b27d0c18a.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack anytime, in any way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How often, how hard, and how you attack is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to disrupt your strategy with their own patterns and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards in your deck? That\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So plan carefully and adapt on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak around danger like a cunning mouse or charge forward head-on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Elementail lets you fight your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/c62eee51ff8fb6219882f08e5fdb1754.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=275 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Did your powerful combo just fizzle out?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an adorable animal wizard, after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store cards in your \u201ccheeks\u201d to hold them for the perfect moment, then release them all at once for satisfying chain attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing elements in advance is another great strategy to unleash devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/1463a2a62823d60562062c8924a02751.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/bb1d45f72f86d9c00f03bf159370e006.avif?t=1755504713\" data-has-big width=1600 height=698 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elementail, animal wizards carry elemental spirits sealed into magical \u201ccards.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cards can be enhanced through coating, seals, and power-ups, giving you a wide range of customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft your signature card!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/e6e0d9da6e4991007fb6ced24b836e58.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.webm?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.mp4?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards aren\u2019t just paper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can be enhanced with glass, metal, and more to gain unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/024a3e3e2ccc90852c91f6aac06a4541.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.webm?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.mp4?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why stop at one spirit per card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp in new elements and unlock combo possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8df3b36a244cc5e7c0515b53d3a707ba.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.webm?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.mp4?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse cards with mana to boost their damage and impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/65307a913323456a12d56a661866cc43.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/996bbc2f89f9907dc54acbd94a66320a.avif?t=1755504713\" data-has-big width=1600 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 relics await you throughout the world of Elementail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one offers powerful, unique effects that shape your strategy and amplify your deck. Experiment, combine, and build your own legendary playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/cee7c0fd1c7fe5c375d75c91f796f0d5.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/5598555ea39d4771081536c336b3b1a6.avif?t=1755504713\" data-has-big width=1600 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re all set\u2014time to dive into the adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths, collect powerful cards and relics, and face off against the wicked wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world of Elementail is teetering on the edge. It\u2019s up to you\u2014and your cheeky animal wizard friends\u2014to save it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Draw. Store. Strike.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards from your deck and store them in your cheek-pouches (yes, literally!), then unleash them all at once at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain same-element cards for explosive combos\u2014or mix elements for wild, unpredictable effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>150+ Relics &amp; Full Customization</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden corners of the map to discover relics that enhance your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coat your cards in glass or metal, inscribe them with arcane sigils, and give each one its own unique powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Procedurally Generated Maps &amp; Events</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different\u2014new routes, shops, traps, and boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe like a sneaky mouse or charge forward boldly. It\u2019s all about finding the path that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Adorable Animal Wizards &amp; a Magical World</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet squirrel, rabbit, and cat wizards\u2014each with their own charm\u2014who guide you through a whimsical, immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dreamy music and responsive sound effects, the adventure feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Endless Replayability</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards and you\u2019ll be defeated\u2014but with each run, you\u2019ll collect new relics and skills to come back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face quirky monsters, uncover special events, and craft your perfect deck in this ever-changing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/343792645b0110f3aefffe1779a6610d.avif?t=1755504713\" width=1545 height=603 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Thanks for everything!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support and interest are a great help to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please add this game to your WISHLIST</strong> if you want to get some quick news from Elementail and be the first to play it when it's released! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And please <strong>join us on Discord</strong> where our dev team is!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We\u2019re Elementail's dev team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re thrilled to finally meet you on Steam\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and incredibly grateful you\u2019ve taken the time to check out our game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve poured countless late nights into crafting exciting strategy within the simplest mechanics: Draw, Store, and Strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 cards and relics, we\u2019ve been eager to share the joy of Elementail with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in battle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don\u2019t worry\u2014you\u2019ll come back stronger, ready to try a new strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback helps us grow and make Elementail even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please tell us your feedback on our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/d1901a011c81f9cc465ce4205ab54d98.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8dde189c53b0ee37b010cf925f3d3327.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a magical journey with adorable animal wizards, harnessing the power of Water, Fire, and Lightning elemental cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementail is a casual roguelike deckbuilder with the feel of a luxurious board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy and intuitive\u2014yes, even a squirrel could play it!\u2014but you'll need clever strategy to overcome quirky enemies and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a world where enchanted animals and elemental spirits coexist,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as a rookie wizard setting out to stop the growing elemental corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, the game\u2019s addictive card-drawing is a bit of a problem... but in the most lovable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/cec98e0e6682d60ae6a591af7ba51d3f.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=211 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Combat in Elementail is easy to learn but packed with strategic choices.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Draw] / [Store] / [Strike]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw as many cards as you like from your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to build up damage and strike down your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash same-element cards in a row for massive magical attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or mix different elements for unpredictable combos and wild effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/19cdf197a8a67655f9b8766f054be310.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=204 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Just one more card...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware your inner greed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdrawing could ruin your combo in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/c76bbf82944715ed148fa15b27d0c18a.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack anytime, in any way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How often, how hard, and how you attack is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to disrupt your strategy with their own patterns and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards in your deck? That\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So plan carefully and adapt on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak around danger like a cunning mouse or charge forward head-on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Elementail lets you fight your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/c62eee51ff8fb6219882f08e5fdb1754.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.webp?t=1755504713\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=275 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Did your powerful combo just fizzle out?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an adorable animal wizard, after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store cards in your \u201ccheeks\u201d to hold them for the perfect moment, then release them all at once for satisfying chain attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing elements in advance is another great strategy to unleash devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/1463a2a62823d60562062c8924a02751.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/bb1d45f72f86d9c00f03bf159370e006.avif?t=1755504713\" data-has-big width=1600 height=698 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elementail, animal wizards carry elemental spirits sealed into magical \u201ccards.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cards can be enhanced through coating, seals, and power-ups, giving you a wide range of customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft your signature card!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/e6e0d9da6e4991007fb6ced24b836e58.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.webm?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.mp4?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards aren\u2019t just paper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can be enhanced with glass, metal, and more to gain unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/024a3e3e2ccc90852c91f6aac06a4541.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.webm?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.mp4?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why stop at one spirit per card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp in new elements and unlock combo possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/8df3b36a244cc5e7c0515b53d3a707ba.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.poster.avif?t=1755504713\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.webm?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.mp4?t=1755504713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse cards with mana to boost their damage and impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/65307a913323456a12d56a661866cc43.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/996bbc2f89f9907dc54acbd94a66320a.avif?t=1755504713\" data-has-big width=1600 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 relics await you throughout the world of Elementail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one offers powerful, unique effects that shape your strategy and amplify your deck. Experiment, combine, and build your own legendary playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/cee7c0fd1c7fe5c375d75c91f796f0d5.avif?t=1755504713\" width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/5598555ea39d4771081536c336b3b1a6.avif?t=1755504713\" data-has-big width=1600 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re all set\u2014time to dive into the adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths, collect powerful cards and relics, and face off against the wicked wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world of Elementail is teetering on the edge. It\u2019s up to you\u2014and your cheeky animal wizard friends\u2014to save it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Draw. Store. Strike.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards from your deck and store them in your cheek-pouches (yes, literally!), then unleash them all at once at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain same-element cards for explosive combos\u2014or mix elements for wild, unpredictable effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>150+ Relics &amp; Full Customization</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden corners of the map to discover relics that enhance your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coat your cards in glass or metal, inscribe them with arcane sigils, and give each one its own unique powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Procedurally Generated Maps &amp; Events</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different\u2014new routes, shops, traps, and boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe like a sneaky mouse or charge forward boldly. It\u2019s all about finding the path that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Adorable Animal Wizards &amp; a Magical World</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet squirrel, rabbit, and cat wizards\u2014each with their own charm\u2014who guide you through a whimsical, immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dreamy music and responsive sound effects, the adventure feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Endless Replayability</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards and you\u2019ll be defeated\u2014but with each run, you\u2019ll collect new relics and skills to come back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face quirky monsters, uncover special events, and craft your perfect deck in this ever-changing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839890/extras/343792645b0110f3aefffe1779a6610d.avif?t=1755504713\" width=1545 height=603 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Thanks for everything!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support and interest are a great help to us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please add this game to your WISHLIST</strong> if you want to get some quick news from Elementail and be the first to play it when it's released! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And please <strong>join us on Discord</strong> where our dev team is!</p>",
    "short_description": "Draw it, Store it, Strike hard! A charming casual deckbuilding roguelike with magical animal wizards! Strategically combine elemental cards\u2014Water, Fire, and Lightning\u2014and collect over 150 unique relics to build your deck, customize your playstyle, and save a world tainted by elemental corruption.",
